pointed","kind":"appointment","source":"Business Insurance","date":"24 Sep","ts":1790258674.0},{"title":"People Moves: Taylor Returns to Plymouth Rock Assurance as President and CEO","url":"https://www.insurancejournal.com/news/east/2026/09/24/886624.htm","type":"Appointed","kind":"appointment","source":"Insurance Journal","date":"24 Sep","ts":1790257326.0},{"title":"Election Commission row: Gyanesh Kumar must resign immediately, says Rahul","url":"https://www.business-standard.com/india-news/election-commission-row-gyanesh-kumar-must-resign-immediately-says-rahul-126092401008_1.html","type":"Steps down","kind":"exit","source":"Business Standard","date":"24 Sep","ts":1790254029.0},{"title":"Ocean Spray names chief supply chain officer","url":"https://www.supplychaindive.com/news/ocean-spray-names-chief-supply-chain-officer/830937/","type":"Appointed","kind":"appointment","source":"Supply Chain Dive","date":"23 Sep","ts":1790162280.0}],"_record":{"quotes":[{"quote":"We've packed a lot of technology with this little guy … So, if you're not wearing glasses, this is going to be by far the fastest way to talk to your Muse and to show it what's going on around you.","leader":"Mark Zuckerberg","company":"Meta","source":"CNBC","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/23/mark-zuckerberg-1299-meta-vr-glasses-ai-agent.html","date":"24 Sep","ts":1790265384.0},{"quote":"We have built a new kind of VR device that delivers the same magical feeling of presence and immersion, high-resolution displays and views of the world around you in a form factor that is a pair of glasses for the first time","leader":"Mark Zuckerberg","company":"Meta","source":"CNBC","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/23/mark-zuckerberg-1299-meta-vr-glasses-ai-agent.html","date":"24 Sep","ts":1790265384.0},{"quote":"One of the great promises of e-commerce since the earliest days of the industry has been that it can save you money and time … Personal agents are going to continue delivering on that promise for a new generation of shoppers, and they're going to help them discover products they …","leader":"Alexandr Wang","company":"Meta","source":"CNBC","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/23/metas-standoff-with-amazon-over-muse-comes-ahead-of-meta-connect.html","date":"24 Sep","ts":1790257779.0},{"quote":"In our history, there have been times where countries who compete and don't always like each other very much still come together for shared interests and the collective good in the face of a powerful new technology … We believe this must be one of those times","leader":"Sam Altman","company":"OpenAI","source":"CNBC","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/23/altman-amodei-un-ai-safety.html","date":"24 Sep","ts":1790252831.0},{"quote":"Beating companies in a competitive race is not a reason to make rash decisions … We have unilaterally slowed down in the past. We will do so in the future.","leader":"Sam Altman","company":"OpenAI","source":"CNBC","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/09/23/altman-amodei-un-ai-safety.html","date":"24 Sep","ts":1790252831.0},{"quote":"With electricity, we could power everything … With the internet, you can find anything. And now, with artificial intelligence as an infrastructure layer across the planet, we can know everything and do anything.","leader":"Jensen Huang","company":"NVIDIA","source":"NVIDIA Blog","url":"https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/jensen-huang-dreamforce/","date":"15 Sep","ts":1789511074.0},{"quote":"Safety is paramount in a lot of ways. It’s job one … However, safety is an engineering problem. We’re developing computing systems after all … If you build a product or a service and you’re not confident in its functionality, capability or safety, then don’t release it.","leader":"Jensen Huang","company":"NVIDIA","source":"NVIDIA Blog","url":"https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/jensen-huang-dreamforce/","date":"15 Sep","ts":1789511074.0}],"window_days":14,"leaders":[{"name":"Sam Altman","company":"OpenAI"},{"name":"Greg Brockman","company":"OpenAI"},{"na